# The vendored digest vectors are compared byte-for-byte against another copy
# in this repository, and a digest is taken over their content. The checkout
# converts line endings for everything the root .gitattributes does not pin, so
# without this line the two copies differ on a fresh clone for a reason that has
# nothing to do with the contract. Everything here is text and everything here
# is hashed, so the whole package is pinned rather than just the one file.
* text eol=lf
